    "https://www.kansasworks.com/job_seeker": {
      "title": "Welcome, Job Seeker!",
      "description": "KANSASWORKS - KANSASWORKS Skip to main content KANSAS WORKS Menu Log In Job Seekers Job Search Create an Account Resources Employers Create an Account Resources Training Providers Search for Programs Create an Account Resources Contact Us Workforce Centers 877-509-6757 Welcome, Job Seeker! KANSAS WORKS is here to help you find a job. Start your search now: Job Search Form Total Active Jobs: 37,360 Keyword Location e.g., ZIP or City and State Radius 5 miles 10 miles 25 miles 50 miles 100 miles in miles Search Have an account? Sign in. Close Username (required) Password (required) Forgot Password or Username ? Use Reset Code Need an account? Create one now! With a job seeker account you can: Perform and save advanced searches to find the job that's perfect for you. Create and post an unlimited number of resumes with our resume wizard. Explore the most in-demand occupations by industry and location. Find on-the-job training and apprenticeship opportunities. Fulfill unemployment insurance requirements. Connect with career counselors for advice and support. How we help job seekers: Creating a professional resume can be intimidating. With our step-by-step resume building wizard, put together a resume that showcases your strengths and experiences with minimal effort. Want a new career? Connect with a career counselor about state and federally funded (aka, free!) opportunities to learn in-demand skills and gain industry-recognized credentials. Manage your job searches, update your account, and receive job match alerts. KANSAS WORKS is mobile responsive and easy to use from any phone, tablet, or PC. Create an account Upcoming Events Need assistance putting together a resume, practicing for an interview, or finding the best career match for you? Want to chat with local employers about job opportunities? View a schedule of job fairs, workshops, and training opportunities near you. This Week Wednesday, September  9, 2026 10:00am CDT to  1:00pm CDT Job Fair Bosch Home Comfort Group Hiring Event Wichita, Kansas Event Details The Workforce Alliance with Bosch Home Comfort Group is hosting a hiring event at its Wichita Workforce Center (located 2021 N Amidon Suite #1100, Wichita, KS 67203) The event is on September 9, 2026 The time of the event will be from 10:00am - 1:00pm Sign up for our Job Fair email list to be emailed directly on future events. Sign up for our Daily Job Postings email list to be emailed directly about current job postings. More Details Wednesday, September  9, 2026 11:00am CDT to  3:00pm CDT Job Fair Patriot Day Career Fair Junction City, Kansas Event Details Flyer Expected over 50 employers to be in attendance. More Details Wednesday, September  9, 2026 1:00pm CDT to  3:00pm CDT Job Fair Heartland Trailways Kansas City, Kansas Event Details (EVENT) HEARTLAND TRAILWAYS [9.9.26] More Details Event Detail More Events Job Seeker Resources Career Planning Career OneStop KS DegreeStats KS Training Information Program Reports Kansas Micro-Internships Disability Resources About Ticket to Work Healthcare Provider Toolkit Form Your Work and Health Road Map: A guide for workers experiencing health issues. Employment Services and Employment Related Law Complaint System Complaint System (English) Sistema de quejas (espanol) Job Search Federal Job Openings KS Civil Service Jobs Job Search Workbook Job Search Workbook Cuaderno de Trabajo para la Busqueda de Empleo (Español) KANSASWORKS Job Seeker Guides Creating a Resume Forgot Password/Username My Calendar Labor Market Information Bureau of Labor Statistics Kansas Labor Market Information Layoff Resources Search for WARN Listings USDOL WARN Compliance Local Area Workforce Investment Boards Kansas WorkforceONE Workforce Partnership Workforce Alliance USDOL WIOA Performance Dashboard Migrant & Seasonal Farmworker Farmworkers Rights H-2A of the Immigration and Nationality Act (INA) Kansas Migrant Education Program Kansas Statewide Farmworkers Health Program Migrant